        "recency": 0.9,
        "age_hours": 15.4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2joens5t22x",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "I’ve been using GPT-6.2 Astra prior to launch & I found it very uneven  & weird. On one hand, it was harder to steer & work with than other models. On the other, when given an ambitious project (make a space elevator from scratch with Blender & Unity) it delivers upwell-tetherline.netlify.app/unity/",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3n2joens5t22x",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-17T18:30:03.697Z",
      "likes": 146,
      "replies": 4,
      "reposts": 8,
      "score": 7,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 2.2,
        "recency": 0.9,
        "age_hours": 22.8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2jbhzsmxk27",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "AI is a general purpose technology has good and bad impacts, the general model should be improving the good and building on it (less crunch, more innovative games, democratizing creation), while mitigating the bad (shovelware, replacing artists etc). Seeing AI as all one thing is a barrier.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3n2jbhzsmxk27",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-17T14:39:18.318Z",
      "likes": 72,
      "replies": 4,
      "reposts": 6,
      "score": 6.4,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 1.9,
        "recency": 0.8,
        "age_hours": 26.7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:3igkkqe5nkm66olc4y2syzpy/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2keaybczc2p",
      "handle": "markriedl.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "On the surface Meta being sued by Muse is funny. Lurking under the surface is a huge problem: AI flooding lawyers, journalists, and politicians with their problems.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/markriedl.bsky.social/post/3n2keaybczc2p",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-18T01:01:42.778Z",
      "likes": 6,
      "replies": 0,
      "reposts": 1,
      "score": 4.5,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 0.9,
        "recency": 0.9,
        "age_hours": 16.3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:3igkkqe5nkm66olc4y2syzpy/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2jltgny2k2t",
      "handle": "markriedl.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "If I were to create the ultimate AI villain, I would create a sandbox simulation for the AI to try to take over the world. I would add an adversary with unrealistic advantages to put pressure on the villain. I would periodically randomly reset the simulation with different starting world conditions.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/markriedl.bsky.social/post/3n2jltgny2k2t",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-17T17:44:38.315Z",
      "likes": 3,
      "replies": 1,
      "reposts": 1,
      "score": 4.3,
